# APKs mirrored into builds/ by the copy<Variant>ApkToBuilds task.
# Ignored by default: each build is ~12MB, and committing one per build would
# bloat history permanently (git keeps every version forever, even overwritten
# ones). To share builds through the repo instead, delete the line below.
/builds/*.apk
